        <mxCell id="update" value="After each release slice:&#10;1. Keep ACTUAL MVP: json_orchestration_state_mvp visible unless the MVP line changes.&#10;2. Update this Markdown and the editable .drawio together.&#10;3. Keep references repo-relative.&#10;4. Move items to Done only after focused tests or full release-control evidence exists.&#10;5. Run: pb release docs-status --json.&#10;6. Do not export images unless explicitly requested." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
